WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.300
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.570 --> 01:38.970
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.380 --> 01:41.850
[Episode 27]

4
01:41.979 --> 01:42.509
[Nanhuai Military General Staff Department]

5
01:42.509 --> 01:43.979
We found another

6
01:44.070 --> 01:45.120
black market arms dealer

7
01:45.120 --> 01:46.620
who had dealings with Cai Fuhu.

8
01:46.620 --> 01:47.570
According to his confession,

9
01:47.570 --> 01:48.560
outside Laifu Teahouse,

10
01:48.560 --> 01:49.840
there is a wooden sign hanging all year round

11
01:49.840 --> 01:51.100
for buying tea leaves.

12
01:51.920 --> 01:53.640
"Buying premium Longjing today"

13
01:53.640 --> 01:54.570
means a meeting.

14
01:54.840 --> 01:56.840
"Buying Huangshan Maofeng today"

15
01:57.140 --> 01:58.940
means there's a change of plans.

16
01:59.340 --> 02:01.290
Cai Fuhu's rank is low.

17
02:01.370 --> 02:02.970
He's just a front man at best.

18
02:03.930 --> 02:05.780
But the person he meets

19
02:06.930 --> 02:08.860
might be the one we're looking for.

20
02:09.060 --> 02:10.000
The manager of Laifu Teahouse

21
02:10.000 --> 02:11.500
is already under our control.

22
02:11.500 --> 02:13.030
The arrest of Cai Fuhu and his son

23
02:13.030 --> 02:14.430
is still being kept secret.

24
02:14.430 --> 02:16.090
We just said they were sent out on duty.

25
02:16.090 --> 02:18.150
And the waiters and kitchen staff of the teahouse

26
02:18.150 --> 02:20.410
have all been replaced by our own people.

27
02:21.410 --> 02:22.579
This person has been lying low for so long.

28
02:22.579 --> 02:23.960
He won't show up easily.

29
02:25.300 --> 02:26.829
We have to set a trap for him.

30
02:27.690 --> 02:30.690
Well, let's spread the news through the black market.

31
02:30.800 --> 02:31.579
Just say

32
02:32.090 --> 02:33.340
that 600 German Bergmann submachine guns

33
02:33.340 --> 02:34.130
are about

34
02:34.560 --> 02:35.760
to flow into Nanhuai.

35
02:36.060 --> 02:38.660
Then hang a sign for buying Longjing

36
02:38.870 --> 02:40.500
outside Laifu Teahouse

37
02:40.740 --> 02:42.540
and wait for him to take the bait.

38
02:53.090 --> 02:53.950
One Character.

39
02:56.870 --> 02:58.130
One Character too.

40
03:00.240 --> 03:01.300
Seven Characters.

41
03:01.910 --> 03:02.780
Kong.

42
03:03.000 --> 03:04.590
Your luck today

43
03:04.590 --> 03:06.600
is truly unstoppable.

44
03:06.750 --> 03:08.030
The Fifth Young Master Yu and his wife

45
03:08.030 --> 03:09.230
have moved back home.

46
03:09.560 --> 03:11.340
Baoru is happy.

47
03:11.410 --> 03:12.610
How could we possibly

48
03:12.620 --> 03:14.280
catch up with her luck?

49
03:18.800 --> 03:20.630
What a demure beauty.

50
03:21.470 --> 03:22.240
Baoru,

51
03:22.240 --> 03:23.970
someone has finally taken over

52
03:23.970 --> 03:25.710
your walnut-cracking duties.

53
03:26.180 --> 03:28.780
He has someone taking care of him in the future.

54
03:30.230 --> 03:31.230
Oh my.

55
03:31.300 --> 03:33.260
Speak of the devil.

56
03:34.829 --> 03:36.060
Looks like you ladies

57
03:36.190 --> 03:37.450
were talking about me.

58
03:37.710 --> 03:38.470
Changxuan,

59
03:38.710 --> 03:40.530
come look at my tiles.

60
03:40.550 --> 03:41.250
No need to look.

61
03:41.250 --> 03:42.910
I'll cover whatever you lose.

62
03:43.860 --> 03:44.800
This child.

63
03:47.180 --> 03:49.680
Stop cracking. Be careful not to hurt your hands.

64
03:49.680 --> 03:50.900
It's fine.

65
03:55.060 --> 03:56.910
I've cracked walnuts for so many years,

66
03:56.910 --> 03:57.630
and I've never seen

67
03:57.630 --> 03:59.210
him care so much.

68
03:59.520 --> 04:01.150
I raised you for nothing.

69
04:02.620 --> 04:03.890
Look at them.

70
04:04.080 --> 04:05.520
With such a

71
04:05.520 --> 04:07.550
graceful wife,

72
04:07.780 --> 04:09.310
it's not hard

73
04:09.310 --> 04:11.840
for them to treat each other

74
04:11.930 --> 04:13.670
with mutual respect.

75
04:14.080 --> 04:15.240
Yes, yes.

76
04:15.240 --> 04:18.370
Such good fortune. Come on.

77
04:18.860 --> 04:19.930
I'm the lucky one.

78
04:22.670 --> 04:24.370
There are so many people here.

79
04:24.400 --> 04:25.460
Stop talking.

80
04:26.570 --> 04:27.310
Pingjun!

81
04:28.540 --> 04:29.600
Pingjun! Pingjun!

82
04:31.370 --> 04:32.240
Let me tell you.

83
04:32.280 --> 04:33.370
I started a club.

84
04:33.370 --> 04:34.450
Many friends have joined.

85
04:34.450 --> 04:35.360
You have to join too.

86
04:35.360 --> 04:36.880
Hurry up and write your name down.

87
04:36.880 --> 04:38.350
What club? A poetry club?

88
04:39.000 --> 04:40.159
The club I started

89
04:40.159 --> 04:41.040
is all about

90
04:41.040 --> 04:42.159
helping us girls.

91
04:42.270 --> 04:43.500
The spirit of the club is

92
04:43.500 --> 04:46.159
self-respect, self-love, and self-reliance.

93
04:46.370 --> 04:47.180
Let me tell you,

94
04:47.180 --> 04:48.370
I thought about it all night yesterday

95
04:48.370 --> 04:49.150
and finally came up with

96
04:49.150 --> 04:49.870
a good name.

97
04:50.180 --> 04:53.290
It's called the Heroine Club.

98
04:55.110 --> 04:56.920
That's the name you came up with after a whole night?

99
04:56.920 --> 04:58.650
Yu Changxuan, what do you mean?

100
05:00.310 --> 05:01.950
Pingjun, you...

101
05:02.570 --> 05:04.430
Mom, Mom, be the judge here.

102
05:04.430 --> 05:05.310
Look at the two of them,

103
05:05.310 --> 05:06.680
ganging up to bully me.

104
05:06.800 --> 05:08.710
You have a lot of nerve

105
05:08.740 --> 05:10.600
to mess with those two.

106
05:10.620 --> 05:11.510
They are

107
05:11.510 --> 05:13.460
thick as thieves.

108
05:17.540 --> 05:18.470
Qixuan.

109
05:19.100 --> 05:21.370
In ancient times, Hua Mulan joined the army in her father's place.

110
05:21.370 --> 05:22.600
As the opera says,

111
05:22.600 --> 05:24.190
"Who says women are inferior to men?"

112
05:24.190 --> 05:26.890
Why don't you call this Mulan Club?

113
05:27.310 --> 05:28.540
Mulan Club.

114
05:29.890 --> 05:30.690
Yes.

115
05:30.930 --> 05:31.690
That's a good name.

116
05:31.690 --> 05:32.500
Let's call it Mulan Club then.

117
05:32.500 --> 05:33.960
Why didn't I think of that?

118
05:34.500 --> 05:35.159
Changxuan.

119
05:35.180 --> 05:36.270
I need to borrow your Fengtai by then.

120
05:36.270 --> 05:37.400
I need to be the host.

121
05:37.560 --> 05:39.360
Pingjun, you came up with this name.

122
05:39.360 --> 05:40.310
So you're involved.

123
05:40.310 --> 05:41.950
You must attend too.

124
05:46.130 --> 05:47.730
Serve them to everyone.

125
05:47.980 --> 05:50.240
Great. I was just about to say I'm hungry.

126
05:57.750 --> 05:58.560
Enjoy.

127
06:05.240 --> 06:06.120
You like this?

128
06:06.980 --> 06:08.310
This is very delicious.

129
06:08.420 --> 06:09.930
Really? Let me try.

130
06:40.770 --> 06:41.550
[Yuxingsheng]

131
06:42.020 --> 06:43.500
[Nanshan White Maojian] [West Lake Longjing] [Guidong Linglong]

132
06:43.570 --> 06:49.150
[Buying Longjing]

133
06:57.280 --> 07:00.010
[Yuxingsheng]

134
07:00.010 --> 07:01.070
You found nothing?

135
07:02.070 --> 07:02.730
Don't move.

136
07:04.930 --> 07:05.590
Be careful.

137
07:14.630 --> 07:15.130
Speak.

138
07:15.860 --> 07:16.520
Changxuan.

139
07:16.870 --> 07:17.800
Someone just booked

140
07:17.800 --> 07:20.130
the private room Cai Fuhu usually goes to.

141
07:20.360 --> 07:22.620
Boren and I have already set up an ambush.

142
07:40.270 --> 07:41.420
Sir, are you alone

143
07:41.420 --> 07:42.500
or do you have a companion?

144
07:42.500 --> 07:43.920
Room Qingfeng.

145
07:44.430 --> 07:45.430
Please follow me.

146
08:04.070 --> 08:05.600
Sir, here is Room Qingfeng.

147
08:15.620 --> 08:18.260
[Qingfeng Hall]

148
08:24.270 --> 08:25.070
Waiter.

149
08:26.220 --> 08:27.480
I remembered it wrong.

150
08:27.870 --> 08:29.400
I want to go to Qinglan Hall.

151
08:30.310 --> 08:31.480
It's on the first floor.

152
08:31.480 --> 08:32.610
I'll take you there.

153
09:02.000 --> 09:03.130
Something's wrong.

154
09:11.050 --> 09:11.580
Hurry!

155
09:11.820 --> 09:13.390
[Yuxingsheng]

156
09:15.360 --> 09:16.890
-Let's split up! -Let's go!

157
09:19.890 --> 09:20.370
Hurry!

158
09:29.140 --> 09:29.910
[Where Guests Gather]

159
09:29.910 --> 09:30.440
Let's go!

160
09:31.240 --> 09:31.790
Hurry!

161
09:34.410 --> 09:34.990
This way!

162
09:39.560 --> 09:40.160
After him!

163
10:00.390 --> 10:01.790
Did you see where he went?

164
10:03.870 --> 10:04.410
Sir!

165
10:04.620 --> 10:06.170
Sir! We found him!

166
10:06.320 --> 10:07.920
He's in the alley over there!

167
10:55.810 --> 11:01.680
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

168
11:01.740 --> 11:06.360
[Infirmary]

169
11:12.150 --> 11:13.080
Cough.

170
11:16.700 --> 11:18.200
She just caught a cold.

171
11:18.240 --> 11:19.080
It's not serious.

172
11:19.080 --> 11:20.720
She'll be fine after taking medicine for a couple of days.

173
11:20.720 --> 11:21.120
For the next few days,

174
11:21.120 --> 11:22.080
don't let her take part

175
11:22.080 --> 11:23.320
in any outdoor activities.

176
11:23.320 --> 11:23.790
Okay.

177
11:23.860 --> 11:25.250
Thank you so much, Dr. Yu.

178
11:25.250 --> 11:26.180
You're welcome.

179
11:26.480 --> 11:27.130
Thank you.

180
11:28.200 --> 11:28.730
Goodbye.

181
11:28.890 --> 11:31.020
Did you remember what the doctor said?

182
11:31.740 --> 11:32.270
Let's go.

183
11:41.840 --> 11:43.820
Jinxuan, have an orange.

184
11:44.930 --> 11:45.730
Come in.

185
11:49.410 --> 11:50.050
Sit down.

186
11:51.890 --> 11:53.130
I'll peel the orange

187
11:53.130 --> 11:55.530
and make you a little orange lantern, okay?

188
12:20.550 --> 12:22.940
Jinxuan, are you sick?

189
12:23.370 --> 12:24.430
I'm fine. I'm fine.

190
12:36.820 --> 12:37.890
Kuang Bingwen,

191
12:38.670 --> 12:40.250
I will hate you.

192
12:40.890 --> 12:42.220
In that case,

193
12:42.500 --> 12:43.300
I might as well

194
12:43.310 --> 12:45.010
let you hate me to the end!

195
12:57.290 --> 12:58.430
The deceased, Zhao Wu,

196
12:58.430 --> 13:00.520
belonged to the Fourth Army along with Cai Fuhu.

197
13:00.520 --> 13:02.150
But according to our investigation,

198
13:02.150 --> 13:03.480
there was no connection

199
13:03.720 --> 13:03.760
between the two of them.

200
13:03.760 --> 13:05.130
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

201
13:05.130 --> 13:07.060
We don't know why he appeared here.

202
13:20.150 --> 13:23.700
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

203
13:23.700 --> 13:24.700
Brother-in-law.

204
13:27.890 --> 13:29.690
You really are a married man now.

205
13:29.770 --> 13:30.860
In the past,

206
13:31.130 --> 13:32.150
you wouldn't come home for a meal

207
13:32.150 --> 13:33.150
even once a month.

208
13:33.200 --> 13:34.130
But now,

209
13:34.620 --> 13:36.350
you rush home on time every day.

210
13:47.150 --> 13:49.080
Why are you looking at me like this?

211
13:50.620 --> 13:52.230
I feel like you've been

212
13:52.270 --> 13:54.600
a bit different lately, Brother-in-law.

213
13:56.200 --> 13:57.200
How so?

214
13:58.700 --> 14:00.160
I can't put my finger on it.

215
14:00.890 --> 14:02.750
You seem to have a lot on your mind.

216
14:04.820 --> 14:06.750
Like you've encountered a problem

217
14:06.750 --> 14:08.460
that even you can't solve.

218
14:14.100 --> 14:15.440
Mr. Bingwen! Mr. Bingwen!

219
14:15.440 --> 14:17.270
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

220
14:17.270 --> 14:18.530
Fifth Young Master, you're here too?

221
14:18.530 --> 14:20.620
Mr. Bingwen, great news!

222
14:20.870 --> 14:21.510
Just now,

223
14:21.630 --> 14:22.540
Director Zhang from the orphanage

224
14:22.540 --> 14:23.270
called to say

225
14:23.270 --> 14:25.320
that Fourth Lady is pregnant.

226
14:38.220 --> 14:39.500
Do Father and Mother know about it?

227
14:39.500 --> 14:40.340
Yes.

228
14:40.340 --> 14:41.530
They are overjoyed.

229
14:41.650 --> 14:42.510
They are waiting for you

230
14:42.510 --> 14:44.010
to bring Fourth Lady back as soon as possible.

231
14:44.010 --> 14:44.360
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

232
14:44.360 --> 14:45.420
Thank you, Mr. Tai.

233
14:45.650 --> 14:46.270
Go now.

234
14:46.500 --> 14:47.830
I'll take my leave then.

235
14:56.650 --> 14:57.390
Changxuan.

236
14:58.320 --> 15:00.050
Actually, over the past few days,

237
15:00.050 --> 15:00.830
Jinxuan and I

238
15:00.850 --> 15:02.650
have been having some problems.

239
15:02.790 --> 15:04.250
She moved to the orphanage

240
15:04.410 --> 15:06.340
and is giving me the cold shoulder.

241
15:06.340 --> 15:07.540
I've been in a bad mood

242
15:08.600 --> 15:09.530
because of this.

243
15:17.080 --> 15:17.940
So do you want me

244
15:18.510 --> 15:19.840
to go with you tomorrow?

245
15:20.890 --> 15:22.120
It's a matter between us as husband and wife.

246
15:22.120 --> 15:23.920
We should resolve it ourselves.

247
15:24.240 --> 15:25.240
You two newlyweds

248
15:25.700 --> 15:27.300
are in your honeymoon phase.

249
15:28.360 --> 15:30.650
Now that Jinxuan is having a baby,

250
15:31.790 --> 15:33.960
rest assured. I'll give in

251
15:34.320 --> 15:35.520
to her on everything.

252
15:37.410 --> 15:39.320
Congratulations, Brother-in-law.

253
15:39.320 --> 15:41.580
I also hope you have a baby soon.

254
15:42.010 --> 15:43.470
It will bring even more joy

255
15:43.480 --> 15:45.840
to our Yu family.

256
16:27.790 --> 16:29.250
Now that you're pregnant,

257
16:29.390 --> 16:31.410
you should work less and rest more.

258
16:32.080 --> 16:33.610
If you need to buy anything,

259
16:34.100 --> 16:35.120
just let me know.

260
16:35.710 --> 16:36.840
During this time,

261
16:36.870 --> 16:38.870
I want us to sleep in separate rooms.

262
16:39.130 --> 16:40.790
You can stay in the guest room.

263
16:41.220 --> 16:42.360
In separate rooms?

264
16:43.080 --> 16:43.700
Then how can I

265
16:43.700 --> 16:44.900
take good care of you?

266
16:45.910 --> 16:47.240
They say pregnant women

267
16:47.550 --> 16:49.250
can be childish.

268
16:50.120 --> 16:51.200
It seems to be true.

269
16:53.480 --> 16:55.980
Keeping up the act for decades

270
16:57.270 --> 16:58.460
must be hard for you.

271
17:05.750 --> 17:08.000
After decades,

272
17:09.810 --> 17:12.810
even the fake becomes real.

273
17:20.849 --> 17:22.329
From the very beginning,

274
17:23.380 --> 17:24.720
I've been your only man.

275
17:25.589 --> 17:26.550
I am very clear

276
17:27.960 --> 17:29.790
about that.

277
17:43.980 --> 17:45.380
Don't upset the baby.

278
17:46.140 --> 17:47.980
You must keep our baby safe.

279
18:27.490 --> 18:30.460
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

280
18:33.330 --> 18:35.310
How has the investigation been going these past few days?

281
18:35.310 --> 18:35.920
Zhao Wu belonged to

282
18:35.920 --> 18:37.830
the Seventh Regiment, Third Division, Fourth Army.

283
18:37.830 --> 18:39.240
The regiment commander was Li Tianjun.

284
18:39.240 --> 18:41.040
Zhao Wu was a company commander.

285
18:41.090 --> 18:42.330
His parents live in Siguqiao.

286
18:42.330 --> 18:44.590
He had an older brother and an older sister.

287
18:44.590 --> 18:45.720
His family was poor,

288
18:45.750 --> 18:46.570
but he had a private room at Xinghua Hotel

289
18:46.570 --> 18:47.770
on a long-term basis.

290
18:50.010 --> 18:51.270
We found these inside.

291
19:01.330 --> 19:03.390
Zhao Wu was just a company commander.

292
19:04.070 --> 19:05.540
How could he have access

293
19:05.560 --> 19:06.960
to weapons and firearms,

294
19:07.180 --> 19:09.440
and be able to mobilize and replace them?

295
19:09.770 --> 19:11.220
And he was bold enough to

296
19:11.550 --> 19:12.460
instruct Tong Chunhai

297
19:12.460 --> 19:13.740
to kidnap Pingjun.

298
19:17.400 --> 19:18.860
What are your suspicions?

299
19:20.810 --> 19:22.410
Actually, Gu and I both think

300
19:23.030 --> 19:24.960
this person should be a scapegoat.

301
19:27.380 --> 19:28.590
You guys surrounded

302
19:28.610 --> 19:30.110
this mole that day,

303
19:30.110 --> 19:31.840
and he still managed to escape.

304
19:32.050 --> 19:33.030
If Zhao Wu came

305
19:33.030 --> 19:34.500
to help him escape,

306
19:35.290 --> 19:36.500
and he decided to kill him

307
19:36.500 --> 19:38.110
in such a short time,

308
19:39.160 --> 19:41.090
that shows just how ruthless he is.

309
19:43.640 --> 19:45.070
The top priority

310
19:45.530 --> 19:48.290
is to thoroughly investigate everyone around Zhao Wu.

311
19:48.290 --> 19:49.740
Someone must have seen

312
19:50.000 --> 19:52.200
him in contact with suspicious people.

313
20:00.510 --> 20:01.220
Qiuluo.

314
20:01.610 --> 20:03.130
I heard Madam reassigned you to serve

315
20:03.130 --> 20:04.390
the Fifth Young Madam.

316
20:06.920 --> 20:08.590
No matter who we are serving,

317
20:08.900 --> 20:10.200
as servants,

318
20:10.400 --> 20:11.860
we just need to do our best.

319
20:12.500 --> 20:14.250
You are so lucky.

320
20:14.510 --> 20:16.460
Before the Young Madam even moved in,

321
20:16.460 --> 20:17.720
the Fifth Young Master personally supervised

322
20:17.720 --> 20:18.830
the tidying of her room,

323
20:18.830 --> 20:20.160
making it look like a painting.

324
20:20.160 --> 20:21.250
He even picked out the ornaments

325
20:21.250 --> 20:22.450
on the table himself.

326
20:22.750 --> 20:24.050
If you serve her well,

327
20:24.290 --> 20:24.810
won't you become

328
20:24.810 --> 20:25.700
a favorite of the Fifth Young Master

329
20:25.700 --> 20:26.830
and Young Madam?

330
20:27.090 --> 20:29.510
Yes, Qiuluo. Congratulations.

331
20:30.590 --> 20:31.570
Shut up.

332
20:32.590 --> 20:34.160
Who are you to gossip about

333
20:34.330 --> 20:35.380
the Fifth Young Master

334
20:35.380 --> 20:36.440
and Young Madam?

335
20:37.090 --> 20:38.750
Hurry up and finish your work.

336
20:39.090 --> 20:40.530
I'm not gossiping.

337
20:40.720 --> 20:42.310
You see, the Fifth Young Master

338
20:42.310 --> 20:43.500
personally oversees

339
20:43.500 --> 20:45.140
the Fifth Young Madam's meals every day.

340
20:45.140 --> 20:46.440
She prefers light food,

341
20:46.440 --> 20:47.550
so the menus in the residence

342
20:47.550 --> 20:49.550
have been changed to suit her taste.

343
20:49.590 --> 20:50.310
That's right.

344
20:50.310 --> 20:50.880
The Fifth Young Master

345
20:50.880 --> 20:52.530
is such a busy man,

346
20:52.530 --> 20:55.130
yet he still remembers these trivial matters.

347
20:55.250 --> 20:56.270
Even so,

348
20:56.590 --> 20:57.720
you mustn't gossip about

349
20:57.720 --> 20:59.920
the Fifth Young Master and Young Madam.

350
21:00.070 --> 21:01.180
Remember that.

351
21:01.570 --> 21:02.720
-Yes. -Yes.

352
21:02.750 --> 21:03.250
Yes.

353
21:03.250 --> 21:04.420
Watch your tongues.

354
21:13.420 --> 21:15.770
Young Madam, the ginseng soup is ready.

355
21:15.900 --> 21:17.200
Drink it while it's hot.

356
21:17.200 --> 21:17.730
Alright.

357
21:18.440 --> 21:19.680
This is

358
21:19.830 --> 21:21.560
the best thing for your health.

359
21:34.700 --> 21:36.960
Why is this soup so bitter?

360
21:38.110 --> 21:39.770
Good medicine tastes bitter.

361
21:39.880 --> 21:42.140
This is made with top-quality ginseng.

362
21:42.270 --> 21:43.200
Young Madam,

363
21:43.230 --> 21:44.560
you may not be used to it,

364
21:45.110 --> 21:47.110
but now that you're in our Yu family,

365
21:47.550 --> 21:49.110
you should get used to it.

366
21:55.090 --> 21:56.420
I'm not drinking this.

367
21:57.180 --> 21:58.050
Take it away.

368
21:58.680 --> 21:59.570
Young Madam.

369
22:00.310 --> 22:02.000
The Fifth Young Master has always

370
22:02.000 --> 22:03.050
drunk it this way.

371
22:03.900 --> 22:06.000
In all these years, he's never left a drop

372
22:06.000 --> 22:07.660
of the ginseng soup I've made.

373
22:08.140 --> 22:09.740
Even when he doesn't like it,

374
22:09.750 --> 22:10.790
he appreciates the fact

375
22:10.790 --> 22:11.530
that I spent hours

376
22:11.530 --> 22:13.500
making it for him

377
22:13.890 --> 22:15.580
and drinks every last drop.

378
22:18.140 --> 22:20.180
Well, you've certainly worked hard.

379
22:20.180 --> 22:21.980
I'll tell the Fifth Young Master

380
22:22.010 --> 22:23.190
that we have enough staff here

381
22:23.190 --> 22:24.450
and no longer need you.

382
22:24.660 --> 22:27.000
I'll send you back to the countryside to get married.

383
22:27.000 --> 22:29.000
I'll have someone arrange it tomorrow

384
22:29.000 --> 22:30.810
and have your parents come get you.

385
22:30.810 --> 22:32.340
No, please!

386
22:32.440 --> 22:34.290
Young Madam, I was wrong.

387
22:34.290 --> 22:36.350
Young Madam, I won't dare do it again.

388
22:36.350 --> 22:37.810
Please don't send me away.

389
22:38.790 --> 22:40.400
Do you really think

390
22:40.400 --> 22:42.450
I'm some spoiled young lady

391
22:42.640 --> 22:44.440
who would be bullied by your words,

392
22:44.440 --> 22:46.280
fall for your little tricks,

393
22:46.400 --> 22:48.400
and cry her eyes out?

394
22:49.050 --> 22:50.510
You're so wrong.

395
22:51.240 --> 22:53.090
I'm not that forgiving.

396
22:54.240 --> 22:56.500
Do you really think I can't deal with you?

397
23:02.830 --> 23:04.200
There are some things

398
23:04.750 --> 23:06.880
that are clearly beyond your control.

399
23:07.270 --> 23:09.110
Why go to such great lengths?

400
23:09.940 --> 23:11.090
Young Madam,

401
23:11.920 --> 23:13.500
I know I was wrong.

402
23:13.500 --> 23:16.250
Young Madam, I won't dare do it again.

403
23:17.240 --> 23:18.290
I'm sorry.

404
23:22.750 --> 23:24.080
I'll let it go this time.

405
23:24.160 --> 23:25.610
There won't be a next time.

406
23:25.610 --> 23:26.410
You may leave.

407
23:26.460 --> 23:27.460
Thank you, Young Madam.

408
23:27.460 --> 23:28.790
Thank you, Young Madam.

409
23:33.960 --> 23:35.220
Officer Gu, I'm sorry.

410
23:36.610 --> 23:38.410
Is the Fifth Young Madam inside?

411
23:38.810 --> 23:39.480
Yes.

412
23:49.900 --> 23:50.550
Pingjun.

413
23:51.440 --> 23:53.550
Director Gu, what brings you here?

414
23:54.250 --> 23:56.290
Changxuan asked me to drop off some documents.

415
23:56.290 --> 23:57.490
He'll be back in a bit.

416
23:59.030 --> 23:59.990
Why did you have to

417
23:59.990 --> 24:01.350
make the trip yourself?

418
24:01.740 --> 24:03.700
It was on my way. No trouble at all.

419
24:09.610 --> 24:11.810
Why didn't you drink your ginseng soup?

420
24:12.850 --> 24:15.110
This soup is just too bitter.

421
24:15.790 --> 24:16.920
What a coincidence.

422
24:17.240 --> 24:18.760
I heard Changxuan mention

423
24:19.140 --> 24:21.070
that you like zongzi candy before.

424
24:21.110 --> 24:22.750
I happened to pass by Yurong Pastry Shop.

425
24:22.750 --> 24:23.680
So I bought some.

426
24:28.010 --> 24:29.740
Thank you so much, Director Gu.

427
24:37.220 --> 24:38.820
-Fourth Lady. -Fourth Lady.

428
24:43.720 --> 24:44.400
Jinxuan.

429
24:45.460 --> 24:46.220
Changxuan?

430
24:47.220 --> 24:47.850
Qiujuan.

431
24:48.180 --> 24:49.290
Go do your other things.

432
24:49.290 --> 24:49.810
Let me.

433
24:51.960 --> 24:53.760
Sit with me for a while, will you?

434
25:01.460 --> 25:02.610
I heard that pregnant women

435
25:02.610 --> 25:03.570
have a hard time.

436
25:03.940 --> 25:05.470
How are you feeling lately?

437
25:06.850 --> 25:08.110
It's been pretty good.

438
25:08.510 --> 25:09.660
I see Dr. Dai regularly for shots

439
25:09.660 --> 25:10.880
to support the pregnancy.

440
25:10.880 --> 25:13.010
It's good to stay active. That's good.

441
25:13.110 --> 25:13.920
That's good.

442
25:14.700 --> 25:15.920
When he grows up

443
25:15.920 --> 25:17.220
and can walk and run,

444
25:17.850 --> 25:19.070
as his uncle,

445
25:19.380 --> 25:20.660
I'll teach him how to ride a horse

446
25:20.660 --> 25:21.520
and go fishing.

447
25:22.610 --> 25:23.960
Since you like kids so much,

448
25:23.960 --> 25:25.760
why don't you have one yourself?

449
25:26.550 --> 25:27.920
Stop making fun of me.

450
25:28.850 --> 25:30.050
It's too early for me.

451
25:33.250 --> 25:34.050
Changxuan,

452
25:35.350 --> 25:38.010
Pingjun is a good girl,

453
25:38.720 --> 25:39.240
but she's not the type

454
25:39.240 --> 25:40.700
to be easily manipulated.

455
25:41.250 --> 25:42.570
Are you planning to keep

456
25:42.570 --> 25:44.610
some things to yourself forever

457
25:44.900 --> 25:45.960
and never tell her?

458
25:48.980 --> 25:50.000
You know that

459
25:50.590 --> 25:52.420
nothing stays hidden forever.

460
25:52.790 --> 25:54.400
If she finds out one day,

461
25:54.850 --> 25:57.550
do you think she can handle it?

462
26:00.220 --> 26:01.550
I understand, Jinxuan.

463
26:02.940 --> 26:04.180
I will tell her

464
26:04.310 --> 26:05.510
when I get the chance.

465
26:07.550 --> 26:08.700
Anyway,

466
26:08.700 --> 26:10.360
this is between the two of you.

467
26:10.750 --> 26:12.000
As your sister,

468
26:12.000 --> 26:13.310
I can only give you a reminder.

469
26:13.310 --> 26:15.040
I can't make decisions for you.

470
26:15.960 --> 26:17.220
It hasn't been easy for you and Pingjun

471
26:17.220 --> 26:18.820
to get to where you are today.

472
26:19.700 --> 26:20.770
I just hope

473
26:21.480 --> 26:24.050
you two will be well in the future.

474
26:39.110 --> 26:40.240
Fifth Young Master.

475
26:40.570 --> 26:42.920
You've been coming back late these past few days.

476
26:42.920 --> 26:44.400
I specifically had the small kitchen

477
26:44.400 --> 26:46.030
make lotus leaf soup for you.

478
26:46.220 --> 26:48.250
It's very refreshing. Please try it.

479
26:48.250 --> 26:49.710
How is Madam's mood today?

480
26:50.380 --> 26:51.510
How is her appetite?

481
26:52.010 --> 26:54.000
How would we know

482
26:54.160 --> 26:55.420
how the Young Madam is?

483
26:55.940 --> 26:57.700
You should ask Director Gu.

484
27:02.350 --> 27:03.290
What do you mean?

485
27:03.900 --> 27:05.850
We maids are clumsy.

486
27:06.170 --> 27:06.780
Usually,

487
27:06.810 --> 27:08.960
we can't do much to help with taking care of

488
27:08.960 --> 27:10.310
the Fifth Young Madam.

489
27:10.660 --> 27:11.660
The Young Madam

490
27:11.660 --> 27:12.750
is literate.

491
27:12.750 --> 27:14.610
She doesn't have much to say to us.

492
27:14.900 --> 27:15.700
But with Director Gu,

493
27:15.700 --> 27:17.760
she has endless things to talk about.

494
27:18.150 --> 27:19.480
It's actually strange.

495
27:19.790 --> 27:21.960
Director Gu usually looks cold,

496
27:22.460 --> 27:24.500
but whenever he sees the Young Madam,

497
27:24.500 --> 27:26.110
he becomes gentle.

498
27:27.850 --> 27:28.980
Fifth Young Master!

499
27:31.090 --> 27:32.380
One is my brother,

500
27:33.480 --> 27:34.810
and the other is my wife.

501
27:37.900 --> 27:38.900
If I hear you making up

502
27:38.900 --> 27:40.100
such nonsense again,

503
27:41.090 --> 27:42.220
I'll take your life.

504
27:44.880 --> 27:45.440
Get out.

505
27:53.700 --> 27:55.510
Fengtai has its own merits,

506
27:55.720 --> 27:57.700
but the garden in Yu's Residence is also beautiful.

507
27:57.700 --> 27:58.960
Isn't it, Young Madam?

508
28:10.500 --> 28:11.790
This is a hosta.

509
28:11.900 --> 28:14.300
It's easy to grow and can survive anywhere.

510
28:31.960 --> 28:33.980
Young Madam, are you alright?

511
28:34.500 --> 28:35.360
What happened?

512
28:36.290 --> 28:37.420
Fifth Young Master.

513
28:37.920 --> 28:40.120
The Young Madam is feeling a bit unwell.

514
28:41.480 --> 28:42.280
What's wrong?

515
28:43.810 --> 28:44.740
I'm fine.

516
28:44.880 --> 28:46.960
Maybe the wind was a bit strong just now.

517
28:46.960 --> 28:48.960
It gave me a headache. It's nothing.

518
28:53.050 --> 28:54.110
What are you doing?

519
28:54.700 --> 28:55.760
What are you doing?

520
28:55.830 --> 28:57.550
Yu Changxuan, put... put me down.

521
28:57.550 --> 28:58.830
I can walk by myself.

522
29:05.550 --> 29:06.610
Hurry up.

523
29:21.440 --> 29:22.500
What are you doing?

524
29:23.810 --> 29:25.410
Do you want me to walk faster?

525
29:35.380 --> 29:35.980
Yes.

526
29:44.330 --> 29:45.770
Call me Changxuan.

527
29:47.370 --> 29:48.830
I haven't heard it all day.

528
29:49.830 --> 29:50.770
I miss it so much.

529
30:00.420 --> 30:01.220
Changxuan.

530
30:05.740 --> 30:06.660
Why does it sound so good

531
30:06.660 --> 30:07.570
when you say it?

532
30:44.740 --> 30:45.270
Hello?

533
30:47.770 --> 30:49.030
Okay. Okay.

534
30:49.030 --> 30:49.940
I got it.

535
30:51.940 --> 30:52.770
Young Madam!

536
30:52.770 --> 30:54.400
-What's wrong? -Young Madam.

537
30:54.400 --> 30:55.370
Master Jin from Xiangxi Hotel

538
30:55.370 --> 30:56.440
called for Fifth Young Master Yu,

539
30:56.440 --> 30:59.240
saying Miss Lan Qing is having opium withdrawals.

540
31:02.180 --> 31:03.180
Get the car ready.

541
31:08.310 --> 31:09.040
Opium paste!

542
31:09.220 --> 31:10.120
Opium paste!

543
31:16.590 --> 31:17.450
Opium paste...

544
31:27.290 --> 31:27.940
Lan Qing.

545
31:28.270 --> 31:28.830
Lan Qing.

546
31:29.110 --> 31:32.270
Opium paste! Where did you hide the opium paste?

547
31:32.380 --> 31:33.650
Give it to me!

548
31:33.770 --> 31:34.330
Lan Qing!

549
31:34.330 --> 31:36.180
Give it to me!

550
31:48.480 --> 31:49.110
Lan Qing.

551
31:52.660 --> 31:53.270
Pingjun?

552
31:56.570 --> 31:57.900
What are you doing here?

553
31:58.200 --> 31:59.930
Where is Fifth Young Master Yu?

554
32:00.510 --> 32:02.800
Changxuan had to go on patrol.

555
32:03.140 --> 32:04.740
I heard something happened to Lan Qing,

556
32:04.740 --> 32:05.800
so I came to see her.

557
32:09.050 --> 32:10.100
Ye Pingjun.

558
32:12.770 --> 32:14.100
What are you doing here?

559
32:18.940 --> 32:20.530
Are you here to laugh at me?

560
32:34.010 --> 32:35.070
Lan Qing.

561
32:36.730 --> 32:38.690
I know you are suffering right now.

562
32:40.850 --> 32:42.780
But you must hold on.

563
32:52.040 --> 32:52.620
Stop!

564
32:52.650 --> 32:53.760
You can't use this!

565
32:54.000 --> 32:54.700
Let me go!

566
32:54.720 --> 32:55.860
-Lan Qing! -Lan Qing!

567
32:55.860 --> 32:57.180
Leave me alone!

568
32:57.280 --> 32:57.920
-Lan Qing! -I don't...

569
32:57.920 --> 32:58.830
Calm down!

570
33:10.810 --> 33:11.740
Don't be afraid.

571
33:12.790 --> 33:13.770
It's okay now.

572
33:14.240 --> 33:15.040
It's okay now.

573
33:16.380 --> 33:17.910
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

574
33:20.420 --> 33:21.380
It's okay.

575
33:43.140 --> 33:44.170
Lan Qing.

576
33:46.680 --> 33:47.810
Ye Pingjun.

577
33:48.480 --> 33:50.480
Stop pretending to be a good person!

578
33:51.550 --> 33:53.240
I hurt you so much before.

579
33:54.660 --> 33:56.270
Shouldn't you hate me?

580
34:01.480 --> 34:02.770
I don't hate you.

581
34:06.740 --> 34:08.070
Because I know

582
34:09.630 --> 34:11.360
this isn't the real you.

583
34:25.230 --> 34:26.570
I don't want to see you!

584
34:26.670 --> 34:27.639
Get out!

585
34:27.760 --> 34:28.710
I don't want to see you!

586
34:28.710 --> 34:30.199
Get out!

587
34:30.590 --> 34:31.460
Lan Qing.

588
34:31.630 --> 34:33.280
Go back and treat your wound first.

589
34:33.280 --> 34:34.540
I'm here. Don't worry.

590
34:37.760 --> 34:38.280
But...

591
34:38.300 --> 34:39.179
Trust me.

592
34:40.170 --> 34:40.980
I'm here.

593
34:51.550 --> 34:52.230
Go.

594
35:06.500 --> 35:07.190
Lan Qing.

595
35:10.480 --> 35:11.280
It's okay now.

596
35:13.110 --> 35:14.010
It's okay now.

597
35:32.280 --> 35:36.620
[Yuchun Theater]

598
35:39.420 --> 35:40.380
Jin.

599
35:42.820 --> 35:44.840
Why bother caring about me?

600
35:48.170 --> 35:51.000
It's better to just let me die.

601
36:06.480 --> 36:08.540
Whether it's a highly effective drug

602
36:09.670 --> 36:11.230
or the best doctor,

603
36:12.420 --> 36:13.210
Lan Qing,

604
36:14.200 --> 36:15.530
neither one can help you

605
36:16.760 --> 36:18.090
get over this hurdle.

606
36:19.210 --> 36:20.740
You have to rely on yourself

607
36:22.940 --> 36:25.000
and grit your teeth to get through it.

608
36:50.630 --> 36:52.340
Mingxuan once told me

609
36:53.900 --> 36:56.940
that when a star is on stage,

610
36:58.530 --> 36:59.920
even if the sky falls,

611
37:02.650 --> 37:04.580
they must finish the performance.

612
37:10.510 --> 37:17.380
Bravo! Bravo!

613
37:20.530 --> 37:21.940
The Lan Qing he knows

614
37:24.530 --> 37:26.260
keeps singing whether there is

615
37:27.380 --> 37:28.610
an audience or not,

616
37:30.480 --> 37:32.340
and she never gives up

617
37:33.820 --> 37:36.020
no matter what difficulties she faces.

618
38:07.460 --> 38:09.920
Pingjun, you're so thoughtful.

619
38:10.260 --> 38:11.260
You prepared so many things

620
38:11.260 --> 38:12.500
for me and the baby.

621
38:14.260 --> 38:16.720
And you even sewed a herbal pillow yourself?

622
38:18.260 --> 38:18.980
Jinxuan,

623
38:19.510 --> 38:21.300
we are family now.

624
38:21.440 --> 38:24.500
I'm happy to do this.

625
38:27.050 --> 38:28.380
You're such a good girl.

626
38:29.510 --> 38:31.210
Sometimes Changxuan can be

627
38:31.380 --> 38:32.820
a bit bossy.

628
38:33.320 --> 38:34.940
But I've seen

629
38:34.940 --> 38:36.600
everything he's done for you.

630
38:37.500 --> 38:40.960
He is truly devoted to you.

631
38:44.690 --> 38:46.170
If he ever

632
38:46.260 --> 38:48.190
does anything wrong in the future,

633
38:48.510 --> 38:49.860
I hope you

634
38:49.940 --> 38:51.760
can give him a chance

635
38:52.150 --> 38:53.810
for the sake of his sincerity.

636
39:00.210 --> 39:01.190
I understand.

637
39:02.190 --> 39:03.070
Don't worry.

638
39:03.630 --> 39:06.420
We are doing great.

639
39:09.860 --> 39:10.990
By the way, Jinxuan,

640
39:11.050 --> 39:13.310
let me adjust this herbal pillow for you.

641
39:13.320 --> 39:14.360
I'll make sure the herbs inside

642
39:14.360 --> 39:15.650
are evenly distributed.

643
39:15.650 --> 39:16.570
That way, you'll sleep

644
39:16.570 --> 39:18.100
more comfortably at night.

645
39:24.440 --> 39:25.370
I'll put it here.

646
40:18.550 --> 40:19.360
Lan Qing.

647
40:21.360 --> 40:22.090
Lan Qing?

648
40:24.050 --> 40:25.780
Come look at your new costumes.

649
40:28.280 --> 40:30.210
Don't buy me new costumes anymore.

650
40:31.550 --> 40:34.610
They'd just go to waste on me.

651
40:41.300 --> 40:42.000
It's okay.

652
40:43.260 --> 40:44.960
The audience wasn't very enthusiastic today.

653
40:44.960 --> 40:47.560
The audience was small. Don't be discouraged.

654
40:47.760 --> 40:49.020
It will only get better

655
40:49.150 --> 40:50.820
day by day.

656
40:52.150 --> 40:53.050
Day by day?

657
40:54.280 --> 40:56.410
I come from the lowest rung of society.

658
40:57.420 --> 40:59.010
My life is like a weed drifting in the wind.

659
40:59.010 --> 41:01.010
How can I even think about tomorrow?

660
41:01.360 --> 41:02.900
If someone supports me,

661
41:02.900 --> 41:03.920
I am a star.

662
41:04.820 --> 41:06.320
If no one does,

663
41:07.610 --> 41:09.710
I'll be begging on the street corner.

664
41:15.210 --> 41:16.010
Lan Qing,

665
41:16.860 --> 41:17.710
you are a star.

666
41:19.210 --> 41:20.010
It's not because of anyone's

667
41:20.010 --> 41:21.340
admiration or support.

668
41:22.610 --> 41:25.070
It's because of your talent, hard work,

669
41:25.420 --> 41:26.550
and achievements.

670
41:27.320 --> 41:29.050
It's because you are yourself.

671
41:30.820 --> 41:31.950
I don't understand.

672
41:32.900 --> 41:34.010
You must

673
41:34.590 --> 41:36.300
always put yourself first.

674
41:37.010 --> 41:39.300
Respect yourself and love yourself.

675
41:45.260 --> 41:46.230
Do you know

676
41:47.110 --> 41:47.860
when

677
41:47.890 --> 41:49.090
I started liking you?

678
41:50.260 --> 41:51.170
Since when?

679
41:53.050 --> 41:55.260
It was raining heavily that day.

680
41:56.360 --> 41:57.620
There was no audience,

681
41:57.900 --> 42:00.030
and you didn't have suitable clothes.

682
42:00.980 --> 42:01.590
But you still

683
42:01.590 --> 42:04.050
finished performing "The Peony Pavilion."

684
42:04.130 --> 42:06.380
[Where Music Lingers and Clouds Pause]

685
42:25.900 --> 42:26.690
Bravo!

686
42:39.110 --> 42:40.050
Young Master.

687
42:41.010 --> 42:42.260
I'm not a star.

688
42:43.260 --> 42:44.500
Why did you stay in the rain

689
42:44.500 --> 42:46.430
to watch my performance to the end?

690
42:46.710 --> 42:48.650
A performance shouldn't be left unfinished.

691
42:48.650 --> 42:50.710
Even if the sky falls, it must be finished.

692
42:50.710 --> 42:53.090
That's what makes a true star.

693
43:20.500 --> 43:21.380
Mingxuan?

694
43:24.360 --> 43:25.570
Is that you?

695
43:32.920 --> 43:33.710
Lan Qing.

696
43:35.150 --> 43:35.760
Do you still remember

697
43:35.760 --> 43:37.010
what I told you?

698
43:40.360 --> 43:41.150
I do.

699
43:42.610 --> 43:45.210
Heaven loves those who love themselves.

700
43:46.550 --> 43:48.480
No matter how bad the situation is,

701
43:48.500 --> 43:50.700
as long as you don't give up on yourself,

702
43:51.210 --> 43:53.250
no one can break your spirit.

703
43:58.860 --> 44:00.070
So promise me,

704
44:06.550 --> 44:07.860
no matter what,

705
44:09.420 --> 44:11.010
take good care of yourself.

706
44:13.650 --> 44:15.090
Keep yourself safe.

707
44:54.820 --> 44:57.350
A performance shouldn't be left unfinished.

708
44:59.540 --> 45:00.860
Even if the sky falls,

709
45:03.050 --> 45:04.320
it must be finished.

710
45:47.840 --> 45:50.100
So it's the Yu family's good son-in-law.

711
45:54.760 --> 45:55.890
Are you sitting here

712
45:57.000 --> 45:59.800
because you think you're not conspicuous enough?

713
46:01.400 --> 46:04.060
I was sitting here waiting to congratulate you.

714
46:09.610 --> 46:12.010
Now that Yu Jinxuan is pregnant,

715
46:12.690 --> 46:16.210
you'll get a share of the Yu family's property sooner or later.

716
46:18.070 --> 46:19.500
You no longer have to stand

717
46:19.500 --> 46:21.160
on the edge of the cliff with me

718
46:21.710 --> 46:23.090
and take any risks.

719
46:25.010 --> 46:25.860
How nice.

720
46:26.920 --> 46:28.650
Shouldn't I congratulate you?

721
46:37.760 --> 46:39.020
It's such a good thing.

722
46:41.460 --> 46:42.260
Here.

723
46:44.650 --> 46:46.130
A toast to you.

724
46:48.420 --> 46:49.210
Wanqiao,

725
46:49.880 --> 46:50.680
you're drunk.

726
46:51.260 --> 46:52.110
I'll help you back.

727
46:52.110 --> 46:53.030
I'm not drunk!

728
46:55.030 --> 46:55.980
Kuang Bingwen.

729
46:58.280 --> 47:00.140
What did you promise me back then?

730
47:01.170 --> 47:02.170
You told me

731
47:03.070 --> 47:04.320
to stay by the old man's side

732
47:04.320 --> 47:05.850
to pass information to you.

733
47:06.760 --> 47:07.050
You said

734
47:07.050 --> 47:08.030
you married his daughter just

735
47:08.030 --> 47:09.400
to get power.

736
47:12.300 --> 47:13.320
You said all this was

737
47:13.320 --> 47:14.320
for revenge,

738
47:14.360 --> 47:15.610
that it was all fake.

739
47:17.860 --> 47:19.010
But what about now?

740
47:21.200 --> 47:22.630
You've made it real,

741
47:22.630 --> 47:23.590
haven't you?

742
47:30.070 --> 47:31.380
I know very well

743
47:33.710 --> 47:35.840
our purpose in coming to the Yu family.

744
47:38.860 --> 47:39.570
Is that so?

745
47:41.010 --> 47:42.150
Then tell me

746
47:44.690 --> 47:46.420
that you've never had feelings

747
47:47.000 --> 47:48.920
for Yu Jinxuan.

748
47:50.650 --> 47:52.210
Not even a little bit.

749
47:53.420 --> 47:54.210
Say it.

750
47:57.670 --> 47:58.570
Say it!

751
48:08.750 --> 48:10.000
You lied to me.

752
48:11.280 --> 48:12.880
For your plan,

753
48:13.770 --> 48:15.670
I married a man I don't love.

754
48:16.210 --> 48:18.920
And I even bore him a child.
